{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55623","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 二十一 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 二十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忙处须闲淡处浓，世情疎後道情通。\n了然得旨青冥外，兀尔虚心罔象中。\n泉细石根飞不尽，云蒙山脚出无穷。\n樵夫钓客虽闲散，未必真栖与我同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55623.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55623","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}